      "summary": "A comprehensive 8,000+ word deep dive examining PayPal's $1.8 trillion total payment volume across 439 million active accounts trading at a depressed 8x P/E multiple. Models a math-driven upside where a 12-15% annual share reduction from $6 billion in buybacks drives EPS from $5.25 to $8.00 within three years even under flat operating income. Identifies key operational catalysts including Fastlane guest checkout rollout, 20%+ Venmo revenue growth, and double-digit expansion in unbranded Braintree processing.",
