      "summary": "In-depth Reddit due diligence analyzing PayPal beyond consumer wallet headwinds, reframing it as an underappreciated financial infrastructure platform. Highlights Venmo's $1.7 billion revenue stream, a high-margin offsite retail ad network built on verified purchase data across 438 million users, $40 billion+ balance-sheet-light BNPL volume with offloaded credit risk, and PYUSD settlement rails. Concludes that $6 billion in annual free cash flow provides massive downside protection and fuel for share repurchases at sub-10x P/E.",
